Project Overview

This project focuses on analyzing customer churn behavior using Python, SQL, and data visualization techniques. The objective was to identify major factors contributing to customer churn and provide actionable insights to improve customer retention strategies.

The project includes:

Data Cleaning & Transformation using Python (Pandas)
SQL-based churn analysis
Exploratory Data Analysis (EDA)
Data Visualization using Matplotlib
Business Insights & Recommendations
