Key Insights
Major Findings
Customers with month-to-month contracts showed the highest churn rate.
Higher monthly charges increased the probability of churn.
Long-term contract customers had better retention.
Customers using fiber optic internet services had comparatively higher churn percentages.
Business Recommendations
Retention Strategies
Offer discounts for long-term contracts.
Introduce loyalty programs for high-risk customers.
Provide personalized customer support.
Monitor customers with high monthly charges.
Improve service quality for internet subscribers.
